00:40:15.554 --> 00:40:16.387
I do.

00:40:16.387 --> 00:40:17.220
- [Liam] Yep.

00:40:17.220 --> 00:40:20.277
Well, so it is about
six months chemotherapy,

00:40:20.277 --> 00:40:21.366
