00:40:21.366 --> 00:40:23.730
and it was like one of the hardest things

00:40:23.730 --> 00:40:24.780
I've had to do in my life.

00:40:24.780 --> 00:40:26.350
- Of course.

00:40:26.350 --> 00:40:27.790
- [Liam] Post coming out of that,

00:40:27.790 --> 00:40:30.360
I basically realized fuck this,

00:40:30.360 --> 00:40:32.300
I don't want to work a normal job

00:40:32.300 --> 00:40:33.790
