- Are you good at selling shit?

01:07:19.657 --> 01:07:20.490
- [Nick] Yeah.

01:07:20.490 --> 01:07:22.584
Right now, I have like Instagram account.

01:07:22.584 --> 01:07:23.430
I have like 80,000 followers.

01:07:23.430 --> 01:07:24.979
I upload like music--

01:07:24.979 --> 01:07:26.700
- Do you make money, bro?

01:07:26.700 --> 01:07:27.533
- [Nick] Yeah.

01:07:27.533 --> 01:07:28.882
- How much?

01:07:28.882 --> 01:07:30.430
- [Nick] So I was earning about 4,000

01:07:30.430 --> 01:07:31.970
the past three months

01:07:31.970 --> 01:07:33.250
just from like shout-outs--

01:07:33.250 --> 01:07:34.160
- That's a good start.

01:07:34.160 --> 01:07:35.523
Yeah, quit school.

01:07:36.730 --> 01:07:37.600
- [Nick] Thanks.

01:07:37.600 --> 01:07:38.433
- You got it.

01:07:42.555 --> 01:07:43.388
- [Male] G'day.

01:07:43.388 --> 01:07:44.390
- G'day.

01:07:44.390 --> 01:07:46.260
- [Male] My question is

01:07:46.260 --> 01:07:49.840
in a world where business is about giving,

01:07:49.840 --> 01:07:51.440
what is the right motivation

01:07:51.440 --> 01:07:52.970
for attempting to make profit

01:07:53.953 --> 01:07:55.680
as opposed to just being a charity?

01:07:55.680 --> 01:07:57.283
- Because you want to.

01:08:00.001 --> 01:08:03.460
There's nothing wrong with making profit.

01:08:03.460 --> 01:08:05.110
In the same way that there's nothing wrong

01:08:05.110 --> 01:08:10.110
with being fully in a charity mindset.

01:08:11.420 --> 01:08:14.580
The motivation is you chose to

01:08:14.580 --> 01:08:15.723
for whatever reason.

01:08:16.787 --> 01:08:18.290
You know what I mean?

01:08:18.290 --> 01:08:19.617
- [Male] Yeah.

01:08:19.617 --> 01:08:20.688
- I think this is something

01:08:20.688 --> 01:08:21.570
that some people struggle with.

01:08:21.570 --> 01:08:22.691
It's funny,

01:08:22.691 --> 01:08:24.140
when I wrote Jab, Jab, Jab, Right Hook,

01:08:24.140 --> 01:08:25.825
I thought I was writing it

01:08:25.825 --> 01:08:29.720
for people that were just always spamming

01:08:29.720 --> 01:08:32.100
and I needed to show
them how to bring value

01:08:32.100 --> 01:08:34.030
so that they could close their sale.

01:08:34.030 --> 01:08:35.360
What I realized after writing it

01:08:35.360 --> 01:08:36.850
was it was really written for people

01:08:36.850 --> 01:08:38.000
that always give value

01:08:38.000 --> 01:08:40.890
and it gave them permission
to ask for a sale.

01:08:40.890 --> 01:08:42.410
There's nothing wrong

01:08:42.410 --> 01:08:44.123
with generating profit

01:08:44.123 --> 01:08:46.760
because at the end of the day,

01:08:46.760 --> 01:08:48.620
if you choose that that's
what you want to do,

01:08:48.620 --> 01:08:51.020
then that's more than okay.

01:08:51.020 --> 01:08:52.900
I think doing good

01:08:52.900 --> 01:08:56.300
is a competitive advantage for businesses.

01:08:56.300 --> 01:08:57.550
- [Male] Okay.

01:08:57.550 --> 01:08:58.383
Thank you very much.

01:08:58.383 --> 01:08:59.782
- You're welcome.

01:08:59.782 --> 01:09:00.951
We're gonna do a couple more.

01:09:00.951 --> 01:09:01.954
I'm sorry.

01:09:01.954 --> 01:09:02.787
I've been over time for awhile now.

01:09:02.787 --> 01:09:03.620
Go ahead.

01:09:03.620 --> 01:09:05.018
- [Argen] Hey Gary.

01:09:05.018 --> 01:09:07.270
My name's Argen from Investicate,

01:09:07.270 --> 01:09:10.510
a buyer's agency for residential
and commercial investors.

01:09:10.510 --> 01:09:13.640
I just wanted to say a
massive, massive thank you

01:09:13.640 --> 01:09:16.130
because you have enabled me

01:09:16.130 --> 01:09:20.017
to just focus so hard
on reinvesting in myself

01:09:20.017 --> 01:09:20.850
and in business.

01:09:20.850 --> 01:09:22.110
I haven't taken a dollar for myself

01:09:22.110 --> 01:09:23.690
for like the last year.

01:09:23.690 --> 01:09:25.310
And it's just been phenomenal.

01:09:25.310 --> 01:09:27.660
But where the business is now

01:09:27.660 --> 01:09:29.700
is I really want to scale out

01:09:29.700 --> 01:09:32.500
with different solutions of
technology and education.

01:09:32.500 --> 01:09:33.580
But at the same time,

01:09:33.580 --> 01:09:36.290
I have my core business of buyer's agency.

01:09:36.290 --> 01:09:37.240
A part of me goes

01:09:37.240 --> 01:09:38.930
do you put them under different brands

01:09:38.930 --> 01:09:40.390
and try and connect them

01:09:40.390 --> 01:09:41.540
but then a part of me goes,

01:09:41.540 --> 01:09:43.060
no, you're building this community

01:09:43.060 --> 01:09:44.870
and you can help them in so many ways.

01:09:44.870 --> 01:09:47.140
How do you sort of make
these types of decisions

01:09:47.140 --> 01:09:48.659
so you don't feel

01:09:48.659 --> 01:09:50.033
like you're cramming
your audience too much

01:09:50.033 --> 01:09:51.410
when at the same time
you could separate it?

01:09:51.410 --> 01:09:53.100
- You pick a decision,

01:09:53.100 --> 01:09:54.791
'cause both could work,

01:09:54.791 --> 01:09:56.313
and you live with it.

01:10:00.780 --> 01:10:02.350
- [Argen] Cool.

01:10:02.350 --> 01:10:03.183
- I think so.

01:10:04.510 --> 01:10:05.880
- [Argen] Do you feel that sometimes

01:10:05.880 --> 01:10:07.340
you can create a brand disconnect

01:10:07.340 --> 01:10:08.880
from putting too many things

01:10:08.880 --> 01:10:11.210
or in your experience of scaling

01:10:11.210 --> 01:10:12.690
and adding services and products--

01:10:12.690 --> 01:10:14.290
- Not if you're able to execute.

01:10:17.330 --> 01:10:19.270
When Apple decided to make a phone

01:10:19.270 --> 01:10:22.250
and not just an iPod, that worked,

01:10:22.250 --> 01:10:23.863
because it was good.

01:10:25.313 --> 01:10:26.950
- [Argen] Yeah, no, fair call.

01:10:26.950 --> 01:10:28.750
- The whole game for everybody,

01:10:28.750 --> 01:10:32.960
for all of us, is execution.

01:10:32.960 --> 01:10:35.113
You can do anything if you do it well.

01:10:36.975 --> 01:10:38.912
- [Argen] Thank you so much man.

01:10:38.912 --> 01:10:40.180
- Everybody told me to
stay in the wine business

01:10:40.180 --> 01:10:43.200
and I would never be
successful in advertising.

01:10:43.200 --> 01:10:45.700
That seemed like far
fetched and disconnected.

01:10:45.700 --> 01:10:47.430
I just thought I could do it well.

01:10:47.430 --> 01:10:50.233
And so the answer is
yes if you can execute.

01:10:51.610 --> 01:10:53.010
Last one.

01:10:53.010 --> 01:10:54.199
- [Male] Cool.

01:10:54.199 --> 01:10:55.829
Hey Gary, I teach people how to sing

01:10:55.829 --> 01:10:56.662
and I absolutely love it.

01:10:56.662 --> 01:10:57.830
