01:11:06.830 --> 01:11:07.730
- Maybe.

01:11:07.730 --> 01:11:09.380
And what I mean by that is

01:11:10.750 --> 01:11:12.300
what I would really audit

01:11:12.300 --> 01:11:13.590
is every other minute

01:11:13.590 --> 01:11:16.540
besides you teaching people to sing

01:11:16.540 --> 01:11:19.500
and you having to do
another job in addition

01:11:19.500 --> 01:11:22.110
to help a mother who's disabled.

01:11:22.110 --> 01:11:22.943
You know what I mean?

01:11:22.943 --> 01:11:24.570
- [Male] Yeah.

01:11:24.570 --> 01:11:27.190
- Maybe you'll click
and get the right client

01:11:27.190 --> 01:11:28.610
