01:11:28.610 --> 01:11:30.085
and all of a sudden,

01:11:30.085 --> 01:11:30.918
you're right there.

01:11:30.918 --> 01:11:32.200
The other option you have

01:11:32.200 --> 01:11:35.740
is to audit every other hour that you have

01:11:35.740 --> 01:11:37.870
that isn't in the full time job

01:11:37.870 --> 01:11:39.850
and the side hustle of singing

01:11:39.850 --> 01:11:42.540
that may allow you to do
more of the singing stuff.

01:11:42.540 --> 01:11:43.510
Do you see what I mean?

01:11:43.510 --> 01:11:44.343
- [Male] Yeah.

01:11:44.343 --> 01:11:45.690
- Usually, the thing,

01:11:45.690 --> 01:11:47.440
when people have to do two things

01:11:47.440 --> 01:11:48.738
that they have to focus on

01:11:48.738 --> 01:11:51.240
is auditing their leisure

01:11:51.240 --> 01:11:53.090
so that they can pour more time

01:11:53.090 --> 01:11:54.580
into their side hustle

01:11:54.580 --> 01:11:56.980
so that the side hustle can actually grow

01:11:56.980 --> 01:11:59.200
while they're keeping something

01:11:59.200 --> 01:12:01.290
that makes the practicality

01:12:01.290 --> 01:12:03.253
of their short term needs viable.

01:12:04.518 --> 01:12:05.351
- [Male] Cool, thank you so much.

01:12:05.351 --> 01:12:06.820
- In the way that those questions went,

01:12:06.820 --> 01:12:10.180
I think half the time it's affirmation.

01:12:10.180 --> 01:12:12.218
I think the other half to the time is

01:12:12.218 --> 01:12:15.680
my lack of education and my lack

01:12:15.680 --> 01:12:18.100
