01:12:18.100 --> 01:12:21.720
has created an extremely simple framework

01:12:21.720 --> 01:12:23.560
where the answer's simple

01:12:23.560 --> 01:12:25.730
and they weren't looking for affirmation,

01:12:25.730 --> 01:12:28.730
they just had so many
contradictory thoughts

01:12:28.730 --> 01:12:30.950
