01:12:30.950 --> 01:12:32.910
just created clarity.

01:12:32.910 --> 01:12:36.260
I think the far majority
of people overthink shit.

01:12:36.260 --> 01:12:38.170
And so it's either affirmation

01:12:38.170 --> 01:12:40.046
or it's simplicity.

01:12:40.046 --> 01:12:41.840
- [Male] Excellent.

