It's not predicated on being tired.

01:13:07.620 --> 01:13:09.373
I always think when I
do this, do they think,

01:13:09.373 --> 01:13:14.373
it's predicated on I'm in mid thought.

01:13:14.660 --> 01:13:18.400
A lot of times when it happens,

01:13:18.400 --> 01:13:21.260
I can feel myself in a zone

01:13:21.260 --> 01:13:26.010
