01:13:26.010 --> 01:13:27.910
I also am very thoughtful.

01:13:27.910 --> 01:13:29.340
What I mean by that is

01:13:29.340 --> 01:13:32.261
this is now the third time I'm at Sydney

01:13:32.261 --> 01:13:36.420
in less than two and a half years.

01:13:36.420 --> 01:13:39.230
And so I'm always thoughtful of

01:13:40.080 --> 01:13:41.320
most of this room,

01:13:41.320 --> 01:13:44.240
whether they've seen it
physically here or online,

01:13:44.240 --> 01:13:47.640
