be, not disappointing,

01:14:04.130 --> 01:14:06.420
but sometimes when you go
see your favorite band,

01:14:06.420 --> 01:14:08.581
you want to hear the hits.

01:14:08.581 --> 01:14:12.350
And other times, you want
to hear something else.

01:14:12.350 --> 01:14:16.140
And for me, I'm desperate
to get people to win.

01:14:16.140 --> 01:14:20.860
And if I can throw this off
speed pitch or curve ball

01:14:20.860 --> 01:14:22.400
